- `golangci-lint fmt` (gofmt, goimports) and `golangci-lint run` decide formatting and lint. Don't argue with them in review.
- Comments explain *why*. Logging goes through `log/slog`; only the CLI prints.
[% if has_cli %]
- Settings go through `config.Settings`. Secrets come from `_FILE`, and are never logged.
[% endif %]
